1 NOTE Daughter of Janaka, given to Lakshmana (1.71.20–21; 1.73.30–31).  Sources: Valmiki Ramayana, Bala Kanda, Sarga 71 (Janaka recites the Videha lineage); Valmiki Ramayana, Bala Kanda, Sarga 73 (the four weddings). Married Lakshmana (Valmiki Ramayana 1.73.30–31, at Mithila).
