0 @shrutakirti@ INDI
1 NAME Shrutakirti //
1 SEX F
1 NOTE Daughter of Kushadhvaja (1.72.11), married to Shatrughna (1.73.32–33).  Sources: Valmiki Ramayana, Bala Kanda, Sarga 72 (Kushadhvaja’s daughters proposed); Valmiki Ramayana, Bala Kanda, Sarga 73 (the four weddings). Married Shatrughna (Valmiki Ramayana 1.73.32–33, at Mithila).
0 @kusha@ INDI
