1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 PLAC Takshashila
1 NOTE Son of Bharata and Mandavi; established at Takshashila (Taxila).  Sources: Wikipedia, “Bharata (Ramayana)” (sons Taksha & Pushkala; cites 1894 Chackravarti translation).
0 @pushkala@ INDI
