1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 PLAC Pushkalavati
1 NOTE Son of Bharata and Mandavi; established at Pushkalavati.  Sources: Wikipedia, “Bharata (Ramayana)” (sons Taksha & Pushkala; cites 1894 Chackravarti translation).
