1 NAME Subahu //
1 SEX M
1 NOTE Son of Shatrughna and Shrutakirti; Shatrughna’s realm of Madhupura (Mathura) and Vidisha was divided between his sons.  Sources: Wikipedia, “Shatrughna” (sons Subahu & Shatrughati).
